###############################################################################
# Q11 -- Computational resources
###############################################################################

# No timings are given; SevenNet MD used FlashTP kernels.

###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - All encoded errors are against SevenNet-Omni (mpa) labels, not DFT (reference type REF). The held-out set is the stratified 12 % validation split; for the pretrained nano it is external data. Totals and per-group values are both encoded as printed.
# - Lattice parameters (Table 1), phonon dispersions, scattering rates and thermal conductivities (Tables S1, S4) are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
